<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="An accessible webpage for exploring a Teachable Machine project.">
  <title>Teachable Machine | Interactive Project</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #14213d;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --sky: #eaf2ff;
      --ink: #1f2937;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --line: #dbe4f0;
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(20, 33, 61, .10);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: #f5f8fc;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .skip-link {
      position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: -4rem; z-index: 10;
      padding: .7rem 1rem; background: white; color: var(--navy); border-radius: .5rem;
    }
    .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }
    header {
      background: var(--paper);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav {
      max-width: 1120px; margin: auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;
    }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; display: grid; place-items: center;
      border-radius: .8rem; background: var(--blue); color: white; font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    nav { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; font-size: .95rem; }
    nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: underline; }
    main { max-width: 1120px; margin: auto; padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
    .intro { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block; padding: .35rem .8rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--sky); color: #1d4ed8; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h1 { margin: 1rem 0 .7rem; color: var(--navy); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.3rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .intro p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }
    .workspace {
      overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 1.25rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .workspace-head {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .workspace-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--navy); }
    .status { color: #166534; background: #ecfdf3; border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem .7rem; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .embed-wrap { padding: 1rem; background: #f8fafc; }
    iframe {
      display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 620px; border: 0;
      border-radius: .75rem; background: white;
    }
    .fallback {
      padding: 1.25rem; text-align: center; background: white;
      border: 1px dashed #b8c7dc; border-radius: .75rem;
    }
    .fallback p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: .8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: .7rem; background: var(--blue);
      color: white; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none;
      transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    }
    .button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f59e0b; outline-offset: 3px; }
    .features {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .feature {
      padding: 1.2rem; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: .9rem;
    }
    .feature strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .35rem; color: var(--navy); }
    .feature p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .93rem; }
    footer { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .nav { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      main { padding-top: 2.25rem; }
      .workspace-head { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      iframe { min-height: 560px; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Teachable Machine Project</span></div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#project">Try the Project</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="intro" id="home">
      <span class="eyebrow">Interactive learning</span>
      <h1>Explore the AI Project</h1>
      <p>Welcome! Open the embedded Teachable Machine project below and explore what the model can recognize.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="workspace" id="project" aria-labelledby="project-title">
      <div class="workspace-head">
        <h2 id="project-title">Live Teachable Machine Project</h2>
        <span class="status">Project link provided</span>
      </div>
      <div class="embed-wrap">
        <iframe
          title="Teachable Machine project"
          src="https://teachablemachine.withgoogle.com/models/vlKKb9FqL/"
          loading="lazy"
          allow="camera; microphone"
          allowfullscreen
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin">
        </iframe>
        <div class="fallback">
          <p>If the project does not appear inside this page, open it directly in a supported browser.</p>
          <a class="button" href="https://teachablemachine.withgoogle.com/models/vlKKb9FqL/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Teachable Machine</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="about" aria-label="Project features">
      <article class="feature">
        <strong>Easy access</strong>
        <p>A clear layout and a prominent project link make the page simple to use.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature">
        <strong>Open to all</strong>
        <p>Responsive sizing, readable text, keyboard focus styles, and a direct-access option support more visitors.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature">
        <strong>Design principles</strong>
        <p>Consistent colors, visual hierarchy, alignment, spacing, contrast, and simplicity keep the experience organized.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>Educational project webpage · Designed for clear and accessible access</footer>
</body>
</html>
